msgstr "遺失物窓口・天狗郵便"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/commons.js:50
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"File a claim, hear what the object has to say, or check your post. Keep an "
"eye on the date: some letters arrive ahead of their applications."
msgstr "届け出を出す、物の言い分を聞く、郵便を確認する。手紙が出願より先に届くこともあるので、日付もご確認ください。"

